<section class="card p-4" aria-labelledby="job-heading">
  <h2 id="job-heading" class="text-lg font-bold">Your job</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-sm"><%= attempt.mission.briefing %></p>
  <% if attempt.mission.kind_signals? %>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-muted">
      Decode each intercept in the Workbench and submit the answer to its question. The mission ends when every
      intercept is solved or closed.
    </p>
  <% else %>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-ink-muted">
    Deal with every <%= attempt.mission.kind_inbox? ? "email" : "message" %>: reply, do what it asks, archive it when you're done,
    or report it if it's phishing. The mission ends when your <%= attempt.mission.kind_inbox? ? "inbox" : "phone" %> is clear.
  </p>
  <% end %>
</section>
